{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beauty Store Simulator is a vibrant first-person simulation where you take on the role of a beauty mogul, managing your own beauty store empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc84 Cosmetics\u2003\ud83d\udc8d Jewelry\u2003\ud83d\udc57 Fashion\u2003\ud83d\udc85 Nail Care</strong><br><strong>\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Hair Salon\u2003\ud83d\udc86\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Spa\u2003\ud83c\udf80 Accessories\u2003\ud83e\uddf4 Skincare</strong><br><strong>\ud83d\udc85 Manicure &amp; Pedicure\u2003\ud83d\udc8b Makeup Counter\u2003\ud83d\udc51 Luxury Goods</strong><br><strong>\ud83d\udc5c Handbags\u2003\ud83d\udc60 Shoes\u2003\ud83d\udc8e Diamond Collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and much more to discover as you build, customize, and expand your beauty business to become the ultimate beauty destination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, attract customers, and become the go-to beauty destination in NY CITY. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming to become a beauty mogul or simply enjoy managing a stylish boutique, Beauty Store Simulator lets you build your dream store and experience the exciting world of beauty retail in a fun, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there\u2014Beauty Store Simulator now offers even more depth with enhanced management features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/c69b764c66e2ff9ece2550e18ff37e35.webp?t=1767966205\" width=540 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your store\u2019s visibility by collaborating with popular beauty influencers for live streaming events. Watch as traffic soars and sales spike with every successful broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/c0edeccaefbf4c41c6475f3e196fadf1.webp?t=1767966205\" width=316 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire janitorial staff to maintain a spotless shopping environment. A clean store not only pleases customers but also helps uphold your brand\u2019s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/9adf3639b367c436dc45425572326771.webp?t=1767966205\" width=393 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves occasionally lurk among shoppers. Employ security personnel to deter pickpockets and prevent losses, ensuring a safe experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/1596b4112405ef062c8c85ae814a6dc8.webp?t=1767966205\" width=455 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring in restock assistants to keep shelves fully stocked and organized. Never miss a sale due to empty displays again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/514ae84fa9e4485f71cf1351d34f388e.webp?t=1767966205\" width=500 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire assistant managers to handle checkout efficiently, reduce waiting times, and even upsell products\u2014making every transaction smooth and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/83125f6df2131e24991a23ef653abb9e.webp?t=1767966205\" width=392 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store with hair salon services. Offer cuts, coloring, and styling to keep customers coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/db5c2a431554c9ca970d8edfedf32ea1.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/db5c2a431554c9ca970d8edfedf32ea1.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/db5c2a431554c9ca970d8edfedf32ea1.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/90eedbfe21723db38b19f19b7385a4c5.webp?t=1767966205\" width=464 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promote your store with citywide video ads and flying billboards, boosting visibility and attracting more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d3ea37611dac0b951e31e7636d1114aa.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d3ea37611dac0b951e31e7636d1114aa.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d3ea37611dac0b951e31e7636d1114aa.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/8e1853191490c168c8b578fd062dc77e.webp?t=1767966205\" width=661 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing weather and time of day. Rain or shine, customer traffic varies, so plan your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/3c69b77d19cdc495326f77eea37b4fe3.webp?t=1767966205\" width=427 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your beauty empire to the next level by expanding into hair salons, spa treatments, and more! As your beauty store flourishes, diversify your offerings and dominate the beauty industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of becoming a beauty mogul or simply enjoy curating a stylish shopping experience, Beauty Store Simulator offers a fun, interactive, and richly detailed environment to build your dream store and dominate the world of beauty retail.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969150?t=1767966205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969150?t=1767966205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/0f7e46f7916ece617ce35f869781c128b9bf95a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767966205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/0f7e46f7916ece617ce35f869781c128b9bf95a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767966205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3972940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beauty Store Simulator is a vibrant first-person simulation where you take on the role of a beauty mogul, managing your own beauty store empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc84 Cosmetics\u2003\ud83d\udc8d Jewelry\u2003\ud83d\udc57 Fashion\u2003\ud83d\udc85 Nail Care</strong><br><strong>\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Hair Salon\u2003\ud83d\udc86\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Spa\u2003\ud83c\udf80 Accessories\u2003\ud83e\uddf4 Skincare</strong><br><strong>\ud83d\udc85 Manicure &amp; Pedicure\u2003\ud83d\udc8b Makeup Counter\u2003\ud83d\udc51 Luxury Goods</strong><br><strong>\ud83d\udc5c Handbags\u2003\ud83d\udc60 Shoes\u2003\ud83d\udc8e Diamond Collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and much more to discover as you build, customize, and expand your beauty business to become the ultimate beauty destination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, attract customers, and become the go-to beauty destination in NY CITY. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming to become a beauty mogul or simply enjoy managing a stylish boutique, Beauty Store Simulator lets you build your dream store and experience the exciting world of beauty retail in a fun, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there\u2014Beauty Store Simulator now offers even more depth with enhanced management features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/c69b764c66e2ff9ece2550e18ff37e35.webp?t=1767966205\" width=540 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your store\u2019s visibility by collaborating with popular beauty influencers for live streaming events. Watch as traffic soars and sales spike with every successful broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/c0edeccaefbf4c41c6475f3e196fadf1.webp?t=1767966205\" width=316 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire janitorial staff to maintain a spotless shopping environment. A clean store not only pleases customers but also helps uphold your brand\u2019s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/9adf3639b367c436dc45425572326771.webp?t=1767966205\" width=393 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves occasionally lurk among shoppers. Employ security personnel to deter pickpockets and prevent losses, ensuring a safe experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/1596b4112405ef062c8c85ae814a6dc8.webp?t=1767966205\" width=455 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring in restock assistants to keep shelves fully stocked and organized. Never miss a sale due to empty displays again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/514ae84fa9e4485f71cf1351d34f388e.webp?t=1767966205\" width=500 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire assistant managers to handle checkout efficiently, reduce waiting times, and even upsell products\u2014making every transaction smooth and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/83125f6df2131e24991a23ef653abb9e.webp?t=1767966205\" width=392 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store with hair salon services. Offer cuts, coloring, and styling to keep customers coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/db5c2a431554c9ca970d8edfedf32ea1.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/db5c2a431554c9ca970d8edfedf32ea1.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/db5c2a431554c9ca970d8edfedf32ea1.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/90eedbfe21723db38b19f19b7385a4c5.webp?t=1767966205\" width=464 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promote your store with citywide video ads and flying billboards, boosting visibility and attracting more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d3ea37611dac0b951e31e7636d1114aa.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d3ea37611dac0b951e31e7636d1114aa.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d3ea37611dac0b951e31e7636d1114aa.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/8e1853191490c168c8b578fd062dc77e.webp?t=1767966205\" width=661 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing weather and time of day. Rain or shine, customer traffic varies, so plan your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/3c69b77d19cdc495326f77eea37b4fe3.webp?t=1767966205\" width=427 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your beauty empire to the next level by expanding into hair salons, spa treatments, and more! As your beauty store flourishes, diversify your offerings and dominate the beauty industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.poster.avif?t=1767966205\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.webm?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.mp4?t=1767966205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of becoming a beauty mogul or simply enjoy curating a stylish shopping experience, Beauty Store Simulator offers a fun, interactive, and richly detailed environment to build your dream store and dominate the world of beauty retail.</p>","developers":["NovaraGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/de6d45ba3a4a6b86f367f8746e5d63510ca127b5/header.jpg?t=1767966205","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MAC OS X 10.15 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel 64-bit or Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  AMD RX 480 or Apple M1<br></li><l